WEBVTT

00:00:20.650 --> 00:00:21.650
It's time.

00:01:57.330 --> 00:02:01.500
THE BIG ADVENTURE OF ZERO

00:02:01.590 --> 00:02:03.340
What... What...

00:02:03.420 --> 00:02:06.050
Here, say "ah," Inyo.

00:02:09.510 --> 00:02:11.390
How is it, Inyo?

00:02:11.850 --> 00:02:13.850
It's delicious.

00:02:14.310 --> 00:02:17.020
Sir! Who is that woman?

00:02:17.680 --> 00:02:21.480
-Oh, she's our new secretary.
-What?

00:02:22.610 --> 00:02:24.650
Inyo, who is this girl?

00:02:25.150 --> 00:02:27.690
Oh, she's more like a pet.

00:02:28.280 --> 00:02:29.740
A pet!

00:02:30.280 --> 00:02:34.490
Oh, Inyo. You've got
pudding on your cheek.

00:02:34.950 --> 00:02:37.000
Really? Where?

00:02:37.330 --> 00:02:38.410
Right... here.

00:03:00.310 --> 00:03:02.150
It was a dream...

00:03:06.690 --> 00:03:08.280
<i>He was so...</i>

00:03:08.690 --> 00:03:10.240
<i>into that woman...</i>

00:03:13.620 --> 00:03:17.660
A flirt like her can appear at any moment.

00:03:18.250 --> 00:03:19.450
That's why...

00:03:20.620 --> 00:03:22.830
I have to become an elegant lady
before that happens!

00:03:35.640 --> 00:03:37.140
<i>I need to find the right clothes first.</i>

00:03:38.560 --> 00:03:40.350
But where am I supposed to go?

00:03:44.270 --> 00:03:46.570
<i>Adults wear suits like this?</i>

00:03:47.730 --> 00:03:51.070
<i>It's just a piece of cloth...</i>
<i>Why are you so expensive?</i>

00:03:52.530 --> 00:03:53.820
<i>It's way over my budget.</i>

00:03:54.410 --> 00:03:56.620
<i>I'm stumbling right off the bat!</i>

00:03:56.950 --> 00:03:57.910
Zero?

00:03:58.790 --> 00:04:00.950
Big-Breast! Why are you here?

00:04:02.580 --> 00:04:05.750
I'm not Zero. Must be a different human.

00:04:06.500 --> 00:04:08.040
What are you saying, Zero?

00:04:08.840 --> 00:04:11.380
Aren't you supposed to be with Inyo today?

00:04:12.050 --> 00:04:14.130
I'm taking a personal day today.

00:04:16.930 --> 00:04:18.260
That's a nice suit!

00:04:19.220 --> 00:04:20.140
Were you looking at it?

00:04:21.270 --> 00:04:24.100
I don't know what you're talking about.

00:04:24.850 --> 00:04:26.440
-Why don't you try it on?
-What?

00:04:26.860 --> 00:04:28.900
It would look great on you.

00:04:29.650 --> 00:04:31.650
No, it won't!

00:04:31.740 --> 00:04:34.200
I don't even have the money to buy it.

00:04:34.280 --> 00:04:38.660
Don't worry. There's no charge to try
it on. Plus, I can cover you, if need be.

00:04:39.120 --> 00:04:39.990
Hold on!

00:04:41.790 --> 00:04:43.160
Welcome!

00:04:51.340 --> 00:04:53.130
Unfortunately,

00:04:53.550 --> 00:04:56.180
that's the smallest size
we carry right now...

00:04:58.640 --> 00:05:00.680
Yes! This one's just right.

00:05:01.010 --> 00:05:03.180
It suits you well, miss.

00:05:04.230 --> 00:05:06.190
-What am I doing?
-What?

00:05:07.850 --> 00:05:08.810
Why am I wearing this?

00:05:10.860 --> 00:05:12.360
-So cute!
-So cute!

00:05:13.030 --> 00:05:15.110
I'm trying to stay away from cute!

00:05:17.450 --> 00:05:20.780
Wait! I feel too naked in this!

00:05:22.450 --> 00:05:23.870
You want to be a lady?

00:05:24.540 --> 00:05:28.580
No! It's not like that.
I just wanted to...

00:05:29.080 --> 00:05:31.380
You know...

00:05:31.840 --> 00:05:33.670
An elegant lady, huh?

00:05:35.050 --> 00:05:38.760
Are you trying to tell me something?
Thanks for rubbing it in!

00:05:39.720 --> 00:05:41.220
What? What are you talking about?

00:05:41.640 --> 00:05:45.770
I'll grow to be that big in ten years!

00:05:46.430 --> 00:05:48.480
What? What's going to be big?

00:05:53.820 --> 00:05:55.110
Well, hello there, Zero.

00:05:55.900 --> 00:05:58.200
Thank you again
for your help the last time.

00:06:04.290 --> 00:06:06.830
Please, enjoy as much as you'd like.

00:06:07.210 --> 00:06:08.210
Yes!

00:06:10.960 --> 00:06:12.340
It's delicious.

00:06:14.460 --> 00:06:15.300
Yes.

00:06:15.760 --> 00:06:17.300
I'd like four more of the same, please.

00:06:18.840 --> 00:06:19.680
Right away.

00:06:23.470 --> 00:06:25.390
What happened to being an "elegant lady"?

00:06:26.060 --> 00:06:27.310
Pudding's a different story.

00:06:30.310 --> 00:06:31.810
I'm very full.

00:06:34.070 --> 00:06:35.400
Very well.

00:06:36.030 --> 00:06:38.570
Anyway, what were you doing today?

00:06:39.530 --> 00:06:42.870
Zero's aiming to become an elegant lady.

00:06:42.950 --> 00:06:44.620
Hey, Big-Breast!

00:06:45.160 --> 00:06:47.370
Oh, I see.

00:06:48.910 --> 00:06:51.120
No, it's not like that, Mr. Daysom. I'm--

00:06:51.210 --> 00:06:53.040
I understand.

00:06:53.130 --> 00:06:55.500
I went through that phase myself.

00:06:55.590 --> 00:06:57.340
Don't just act like you understand me!

00:06:58.210 --> 00:07:01.430
I can't thank you or Inyo enough.

00:07:02.010 --> 00:07:04.800
If I can do anything to help,
it would be my pleasure.

00:07:04.890 --> 00:07:06.890
Hey! I don't need a rich man
to sympathize with me!

00:07:06.970 --> 00:07:08.770
Leave it to me.

00:07:09.640 --> 00:07:11.060
Let's see...

00:07:11.140 --> 00:07:13.730
Why don't we try a different hairstyle?

00:07:14.400 --> 00:07:16.230
Hairstyle?

00:07:20.030 --> 00:07:23.110
What is that? A creature from Magmell?

00:07:23.700 --> 00:07:25.990
He's a hairstylist, Zero.

00:07:26.370 --> 00:07:28.080
Oh, come on, Daysom.

00:07:28.620 --> 00:07:30.870
It's "she" not "he," got it?

00:07:32.210 --> 00:07:33.120
Forgive me.

00:07:34.170 --> 00:07:37.960
She's a hair designer
who studied in London.

00:07:38.340 --> 00:07:40.470
She's my go-to hairstylist.

00:07:41.300 --> 00:07:44.260
Why is her hair a little weird?

00:07:44.340 --> 00:07:46.050
How cute!

00:07:46.720 --> 00:07:50.140
She's triggering my passion
to be creative!

00:07:50.730 --> 00:07:52.270
Zero, you got this!

00:07:53.270 --> 00:07:56.020
How's this? I went for
the elegant lady look.

00:07:56.110 --> 00:07:58.110
Gorgeous, very elegant!

00:07:58.190 --> 00:08:00.530
Wow, you look great, Zero.

00:08:01.700 --> 00:08:03.860
It's definitely going to
be the trend this year.

00:08:04.160 --> 00:08:07.030
-In your dreams.
-What? Oh, no...

00:08:07.870 --> 00:08:09.660
I accentuated the girl in you.

00:08:09.950 --> 00:08:12.290
Why do you need to make
it explode like this?

00:08:13.210 --> 00:08:15.250
Now this is what I call an explosion.

00:08:16.210 --> 00:08:17.790
I saw it coming.

00:08:20.090 --> 00:08:23.380
How's that? An elegant dark tone.

00:08:29.140 --> 00:08:31.810
Pretty! It looks good, Zero.

00:08:32.350 --> 00:08:34.100
But...

00:08:35.270 --> 00:08:37.310
Exactly. But...

00:08:38.980 --> 00:08:41.230
She needs a little more height...

00:08:45.780 --> 00:08:48.070
Do you have any medicine
that will make you taller?

00:08:48.280 --> 00:08:50.990
Medicine that makes you taller?

00:08:51.080 --> 00:08:53.580
Yes, medicine to get taller.

00:08:53.960 --> 00:08:58.500
<i>Her breasts are excellent-- no, fantastic!</i>

00:08:58.880 --> 00:09:00.050
I'll report you.

00:09:00.920 --> 00:09:04.470
So, medicine that makes
you taller, you say?

00:09:05.180 --> 00:09:09.010
It's not that I don't have it... But...

00:09:09.510 --> 00:09:14.230
It doesn't matter if it's very expensive.
I'll cover the cost.

00:09:14.600 --> 00:09:17.650
No, it's not about the price...

00:09:19.480 --> 00:09:20.900
Is it in Magmell?

00:09:21.480 --> 00:09:22.980
Exactly right, miss.

00:09:23.860 --> 00:09:28.200
There's a tree that bears fruit
that makes you taller.

00:09:28.570 --> 00:09:29.490
-What?
-What?

00:09:30.240 --> 00:09:31.580
Please take a look.

00:09:32.200 --> 00:09:34.750
See? That's the fruit right there.

00:09:36.710 --> 00:09:40.380
Of course, as you know,
since it's in Magmell,

00:09:40.460 --> 00:09:42.460
we don't really know
if this data is valid.

00:09:43.170 --> 00:09:44.010
Let's go.

00:09:44.710 --> 00:09:47.590
What do you mean? Where?

00:09:47.680 --> 00:09:49.140
To Magmell, of course.

00:09:49.220 --> 00:09:50.600
What?

00:09:50.680 --> 00:09:53.640
Big-Breast, quit that pose, will you?

00:09:54.020 --> 00:09:55.520
What? What do you mean?

00:09:56.020 --> 00:09:58.770
Now, can you lead the way?

00:09:58.850 --> 00:10:01.150
What? Why me?

00:10:04.190 --> 00:10:05.280
This is defective.

00:10:06.150 --> 00:10:08.110
All right, then.

00:10:08.820 --> 00:10:12.080
Zero, you should contact Inyo too.

00:10:13.080 --> 00:10:14.120
Well...

00:10:14.410 --> 00:10:16.700
How are we supposed to get there anyway?

00:10:16.790 --> 00:10:19.370
Let me take care of that.

00:10:23.290 --> 00:10:25.050
What are we gonna do at a pool?

00:10:25.760 --> 00:10:27.380
Please, take a look.

00:10:41.810 --> 00:10:43.820
So, what do you think?

00:10:44.570 --> 00:10:47.530
Are you sure you don't need
to tell Inyo about this?

00:10:49.400 --> 00:10:51.240
Zero, shall we get going?

00:10:54.080 --> 00:10:55.080
Zero?

00:11:01.540 --> 00:11:03.750
-Let's go!
-Zero?

00:11:14.140 --> 00:11:15.310
I slept well.

00:11:26.730 --> 00:11:27.940
<i>So we're really here.</i>

00:11:29.070 --> 00:11:31.200
<i>Don't worry, it'll be fine.</i>

00:11:31.280 --> 00:11:33.490
<i>All we have to do is leave</i>
<i>as soon as we find the fruit.</i>

00:11:35.070 --> 00:11:36.080
But...

00:11:36.580 --> 00:11:40.040
Zero, Magmell is extremely dangerous.

00:11:40.500 --> 00:11:44.580
Better be safe than sorry. We never know
when a monster's approaching.

00:11:45.080 --> 00:11:46.130
You're right.

00:11:46.590 --> 00:11:48.800
But would you care for some lunch
before the hunt?

00:11:48.880 --> 00:11:50.010
You're in shorts?

00:11:51.340 --> 00:11:52.180
Lunch?

00:11:53.010 --> 00:11:53.840
What?

00:11:54.760 --> 00:11:57.180
-You can't fight on an empty stomach.
-Amazing!

00:11:57.600 --> 00:11:59.520
We won't be able to relax for a while.

00:12:00.100 --> 00:12:02.440
We should at least enjoy some lunch.

00:12:07.900 --> 00:12:09.900
Wow, I'm so full.

00:12:10.570 --> 00:12:14.450
I never thought I'd get to enjoy
such a wonderful meal in Magmell.

00:12:14.820 --> 00:12:17.410
I'm glad you enjoyed it.

00:12:19.240 --> 00:12:20.660
Monster!

00:12:23.920 --> 00:12:24.830
Wait a minute!

00:12:30.840 --> 00:12:32.010
Mr. Den-Den!

00:12:33.010 --> 00:12:37.010
<i>This is the moment I redeem</i>
<i>myself from humiliation.</i>

00:12:40.810 --> 00:12:41.770
I can't die yet!

00:12:50.400 --> 00:12:54.280
<i>I've trained so hard since then.</i>
<i>I'll defeat this one in no time.</i>

00:12:54.900 --> 00:12:58.660
<i>Then Ms. Fantastic Breasts Emilia</i>
<i>will magically fall for me and...</i>

00:12:59.780 --> 00:13:01.240
Please. Stay back.

00:13:03.250 --> 00:13:04.790
<i>Calm down.</i>

00:13:05.120 --> 00:13:08.630
<i>You have to look cool</i>
<i>in front of Ms. Fantastic Breasts!</i>

00:13:11.500 --> 00:13:12.880
Zero, stay back!

00:13:13.340 --> 00:13:14.170
Here you go.

00:13:14.970 --> 00:13:16.130
What?

00:13:18.180 --> 00:13:19.180
I've got a potato too.

00:13:21.180 --> 00:13:22.100
What?

00:13:22.970 --> 00:13:24.180
This one's a herbivore.

00:13:24.640 --> 00:13:25.560
What?

00:13:53.880 --> 00:13:55.340
What?

00:13:59.220 --> 00:14:01.760
Help me! Somebody!

00:14:08.770 --> 00:14:10.190
Wait!

00:14:17.990 --> 00:14:18.820
This might be it.

00:14:20.950 --> 00:14:22.700
We need to check its fruit.

00:14:23.530 --> 00:14:24.410
Big-Breast!

00:14:28.410 --> 00:14:29.330
Help me up!

00:14:29.750 --> 00:14:30.790
Okay!

00:14:38.550 --> 00:14:40.970
Hey! Your legs are rubbing
against my breasts...

00:14:41.470 --> 00:14:43.470
Because they're unnecessarily big!

00:14:44.010 --> 00:14:45.470
Don't move around too much.

00:14:49.600 --> 00:14:50.440
Got it!

00:14:55.730 --> 00:14:58.280
Is everyone okay?

00:14:58.950 --> 00:15:00.280
I... I got one!

00:15:02.820 --> 00:15:03.700
Here, eat it.

00:15:04.200 --> 00:15:05.160
What? Me?

00:15:07.200 --> 00:15:08.620
Why me?

00:15:13.040 --> 00:15:13.880
What?

00:15:16.250 --> 00:15:18.090
Nothing changed.

00:15:19.760 --> 00:15:22.390
There's no such thing as
fruit that makes you taller--

00:15:22.470 --> 00:15:23.470
What?

00:15:23.930 --> 00:15:26.760
What the heck is this?

00:15:27.220 --> 00:15:29.230
He did get taller, but...

00:15:29.310 --> 00:15:31.020
This isn't what we're looking for.

00:15:34.150 --> 00:15:35.610
Here's the next spot.

00:15:39.110 --> 00:15:40.740
I'm glad I got back to my original height.

00:15:41.200 --> 00:15:43.280
-Hey! Look over there.
-What?

00:15:44.370 --> 00:15:45.240
Wait, which one?

00:15:45.700 --> 00:15:46.830
Look! Over there!

00:15:47.450 --> 00:15:48.580
Where are you pointing?

00:15:48.910 --> 00:15:50.250
I said, right there!

00:15:50.710 --> 00:15:52.170
What do you mean by "there"?

00:16:01.590 --> 00:16:02.840
That's not it either.

00:16:03.340 --> 00:16:04.890
Nope, not at all.

00:16:07.140 --> 00:16:10.430
No way! That's too risky!

00:16:10.520 --> 00:16:13.520
But this is the fruit
that'll change it back.

00:16:14.060 --> 00:16:14.940
Liar!

00:16:18.150 --> 00:16:19.780
See? It changed back.

00:16:23.150 --> 00:16:28.490
What the heck? I'm way too big!

00:16:29.450 --> 00:16:32.330
Well, at least he did get bigger...

00:16:33.080 --> 00:16:34.000
Yup.

00:16:39.710 --> 00:16:42.170
I'm glad to be myself again.

00:16:42.800 --> 00:16:45.260
We couldn't find what we wanted though.

00:16:47.640 --> 00:16:50.390
We still have two or three
locations to check.

00:16:50.720 --> 00:16:52.230
Let's not give up yet.

00:16:53.560 --> 00:16:55.140
What's happening?

00:16:58.400 --> 00:17:01.860
This can't be. We're still
in the safe zone.

00:17:03.440 --> 00:17:04.740
Monster!

00:17:18.790 --> 00:17:20.550
I missed my chance last time.

00:17:24.630 --> 00:17:25.680
<i>I'm done for!</i>

00:17:29.640 --> 00:17:30.680
Hurry up and run!

00:17:40.650 --> 00:17:42.820
What in the world is this?

00:17:51.830 --> 00:17:54.290
We're finished!

00:18:04.920 --> 00:18:05.920
Inyo!

00:18:07.430 --> 00:18:08.430
Sir!

00:18:09.550 --> 00:18:10.550
I'm here.

00:18:13.890 --> 00:18:15.350
Hurry up and get out of there!

00:18:38.040 --> 00:18:38.910
Let's go now!

00:18:39.420 --> 00:18:42.420
Easy to say. But how?

00:18:42.920 --> 00:18:44.800
-I've got a good idea.
-What?

00:18:45.460 --> 00:18:46.300
This!

00:18:46.760 --> 00:18:48.420
Do you mean...?

00:18:48.510 --> 00:18:49.720
That's a great idea.

00:18:49.800 --> 00:18:51.050
Hey! Cut it out!

00:18:52.010 --> 00:18:54.060
Stop it!

00:18:59.850 --> 00:19:02.690
It's not working. I need to flip it over.

00:19:15.490 --> 00:19:17.410
Go! Robot Den-Den!

00:19:18.160 --> 00:19:19.960
Who are you calling a robot?

00:19:20.460 --> 00:19:22.500
So, how do I do this?

00:19:23.080 --> 00:19:24.790
-Use this!
-What?

00:19:26.590 --> 00:19:29.260
-Den-Den Kick!
-What?

00:19:31.430 --> 00:19:32.300
Way to go!

00:19:34.550 --> 00:19:35.850
Take that!

00:19:37.390 --> 00:19:38.390
What?

00:19:40.600 --> 00:19:43.020
-Don't lose, Robot Den-Den!
-Go!

00:19:52.410 --> 00:19:53.240
Nice.

00:20:12.300 --> 00:20:14.390
Have a safe trip back!

00:20:14.930 --> 00:20:16.510
See you later!

00:20:18.310 --> 00:20:20.140
I'll never be able to redeem myself.

00:20:20.220 --> 00:20:24.730
We couldn't help Zero
achieve her goal after all.

00:20:25.690 --> 00:20:28.770
Maybe it didn't really matter.

00:20:30.400 --> 00:20:31.690
-See?
-What?

00:20:35.410 --> 00:20:37.910
Take care! See you later!

00:20:38.870 --> 00:20:39.700
Sir.

00:20:41.870 --> 00:20:45.370
I'm sorry I went to Magmell
without telling you.

00:20:46.040 --> 00:20:47.210
Uncle Den-Den was...

00:20:47.960 --> 00:20:53.970
working on a new business venture
and he had this book...

00:20:54.050 --> 00:20:55.090
That book, huh?

00:20:56.430 --> 00:20:58.390
The book that Uncle Den-Den had, right?

00:20:59.260 --> 00:21:00.770
I sold that to him.

00:21:00.850 --> 00:21:01.680
What?

00:21:02.520 --> 00:21:05.810
I rushed to get over here.
I'm glad I made it in time.

00:21:06.600 --> 00:21:08.940
So... that book...

00:21:09.360 --> 00:21:11.320
Yup, it's fake.

00:21:11.650 --> 00:21:13.690
But he really did get bigger!

00:21:13.780 --> 00:21:14.820
Zero.

00:21:15.950 --> 00:21:18.320
Don't forget about me next time.

00:21:22.290 --> 00:21:23.700
Yes.

00:21:25.370 --> 00:21:27.250
-Did you have fun?
-Yes!

00:21:28.290 --> 00:21:29.750
You have great friends.

00:21:30.290 --> 00:21:33.840
Yes! They all went out
of their way for me.

00:21:35.050 --> 00:21:36.180
I'm glad to hear it.

00:21:37.130 --> 00:21:37.970
Yes!

00:23:11.020 --> 00:23:12.100
PREVIEW

00:23:12.190 --> 00:23:14.650
<i>Master did great work as always today.</i>

00:23:15.150 --> 00:23:15.980
<i>It's impressive!</i>

00:23:16.690 --> 00:23:18.570
<i>But a nuisance appeared.</i>

00:23:19.240 --> 00:23:21.610
<i>The man who appeared before us</i>

00:23:22.070 --> 00:23:25.450
<i>has an abnormally strong attachment</i>
<i>to living things.</i>

00:23:25.830 --> 00:23:30.120
<i>It's very troubling, if you ask me.</i>

00:23:30.620 --> 00:23:32.790
<i>He's a little strange, to say the least.</i>

00:23:33.500 --> 00:23:35.630
<i>Honestly, he's really creepy.</i>

00:23:37.050 --> 00:23:39.420
<i>Next time, "Monster Mania." Don't miss it.</i>

00:23:39.880 --> 00:23:41.880
Subtitle translation by Sachiko Takahashi
